[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"速递员","text":"“有您的快递――”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天不到傍晚的时候，快递的包裹送到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"箱子用胶带封着，保持着我当初收进壁橱时的状态。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好怀念，有一种家里的味道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抓紧打开，在箱子里面翻找。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我记得是放在了这里……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"《胡子猫团的探险》。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和鸥行李箱里的是同一本书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从图书馆借来看过之后……央求父母给我买了一本。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放在书旁边的，还有另一样东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看了下寄件人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那里……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"写着‘久岛鸥’。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是的，我收到了回信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我所寄出的那封傲慢的慕名信的回信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这座岛上我们初次相会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是在这么早之前，我们便有了交集点。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘谢谢你写信给我。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘鸥她们最后约好了，将来要再次相遇，再次找到海盗船。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘下次要去经历更加棒的探险。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘如果你能珍藏着这份回忆。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘10年后，我会邀请你来参加终极探险。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"信","text":"‘如果届时能相遇的话，我会非常高兴的。’"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在船上找到了那么多的信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可能鸥也给其他的寄信人写了类似的回信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说什么10年后，我会邀请你来参加终极探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥她……是真的，打算实现这份承诺。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25658"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i100"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和母亲一起，为了将来的这一天而做准备。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i108"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藏起钥匙，整修洞窟……在海湾准备好船只。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了重现书本里所描绘的冒险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥打算邀请曾经互相写过信件的，从来没有见过面的朋友们。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25658"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1268"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定能和他们相处得像是老朋友一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥大概觉得一定能这样吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为那本书，让大家拥有了共同的回忆。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那个计划还没有达成，鸥就已经无法来到这座岛上了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1277"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在遥远国度的医院中，即便是现在，也几乎一直沉睡着。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，鸥在这个夏天出现了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她无论如何都想实现约定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和鹭阿姨带来的行李箱一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"越过大海。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后……"},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1050"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"出现在了……我的眼前。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1252"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和我一起探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然只有一名同伴，但是也如同小说描绘的一样进行了探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是这么一回事吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，梦想达成了，鸥便消失不见了吗。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]